{"code": "retail_circuit_breaker", "date": "2026-09-26", "verdict": "added", "signals": {"problem": "retail S1/S2/S3/S4 no circuit breaker, WAF hard-block causes per-item idle spinning", "evidence": "no_item top: thebrick_ca 1712x, leons_ca 1406x, amazon_ca 788x; 30 L2 sites search all 403; 4 sites PDP reachable but 0 price (brand display sites)", "solution": "Added 4 thresholds in config.py: MAX_CONSECUTIVE_SEARCH_BLOCKED=3, MAX_CONSECUTIVE_PDP_BLOCKED=5, MAX_CONSECUTIVE_NO_PRICE=10, MAX_CONSECUTIVE_REVIEW_BLOCKED=3. Break logic added to S1 PDP loop, S2 search loop, S3 PDP loop, S4 review loop. On success reset counter. Circuit break logged to crawl_error table."}, "result": {"config_file": "overseas/config.py - 4 new env-overridable thresholds", "scenarios_file": "overseas/scenarios.py - S1/S2/S3/S4 circuit break logic", "savings": "est 90%+ idle time reduction for WAF-blocked sites", "log": "crawl_error kind=circuit_break / no_price_circuit"}, "lesson": "retail-line WAF hard-block per-item idle spinning is the biggest time waste; SPEC line already had MAX_CONSECUTIVE_SERIES_FAILURES=5/MAX_CONSECUTIVE_MODEL_FAILURES=3 but retail line was missing it; circuit breaker thresholds are env-overridable via OVERSEAS_MAX_CONSECUTIVE_*; brand display sites (hisense_co/pe, philips_de) need no-price detection (10 consecutive) not just blocked detection; circuit break records written to crawl_error for auditability"}
{"code": "quality_fix_model_price_review", "verdict": "success", "lesson": "数据质量修复: product.model 空值从 title/url slug 提取(尺寸前缀\\d{2,3}[A-Z][A-Z0-9]+ 或品牌前缀UN/QN/GU/GQ/HYLED 或独立alnum含字母+数字); 提取不到保留空(缺>错)。QLED/OLED/LED 是显示类型非型号前缀, 遇 QLED+UN 拼接需剥离(QLEDUN98DU9000PXPA→UN98DU9000PXPA) 但保留 OLED55B6PSA(OLED后是数字=真LG型号)。price>50M 的 COP 价(哥伦比亚比索~4000/USD)对旗舰大屏(115UX/115X955MAX/OLED77Z2)是真实的, 不能照搬CLP(智利比索~900/USD)的÷100修复, 否则把正确的$25k电视改成$250荒谬错价。review 的 body空+rating空 同时满足才删(本库0条), body空有rating=评分有价值保留, body有rating空=评价文字有价值保留。", "result": "model修复2950条(4879→1929空); brand修复135条(296→161空); price 6条异常经验证为正确COP旗舰电视价保留不修(0修复); review删除0条(无body+rating双空记录, 保留2192 body空+627 rating空); wal_checkpoint TRUNCATE; 总product 10287 model非空8358(81%)", "signals": {"model_extraction": "title优先: \\d{2,3}[A-Z][A-Z0-9]{1,18} (50AU7090) | (UN|QN|GU|GQ|HYLED|UR)[A-Z0-9]{4,20} | [A-Z0-9]{4,20}含字母+数字; 排除SMART/LED/UHD等描述词", "qled_concat_fix": "QLED/OLED/LED 后跟 UN/QN/GU/GQ/HYLED/UR 时剥离显示类型前缀(QLEDUN98→UN98); OLED后跟数字则保留(OLED55B6PSA是真LG型号)", "cop_vs_clp": "COP(哥伦比亚~4000/USD) vs CLP(智利~900/USD) 是不同货币, exito_co/jumbo_co 的 COP 旗舰大屏价 50M-100M COP=$12k-25k 真实, 不可套用 tcl_cl 的 CLP ÷100 修复逻辑", "review_empty_rule": "删 body空 AND rating空(0条); 保留 body空+rating有(评分价值); 保留 body有+rating空(评价文字价值)"}}
