{"code": "_full_crawl_20260927", "entry_url": "5步全流程 SPEC23站+S2-151站+S3-28站+S1-16站+S4-20站", "date": "2026-09-27", "verdict": "partial", "signals": {"spec_crawl": "21/23站成功 +65920行规格", "s2_model_monitor": "153runs覆盖151站 WAF熔断~40站", "s3_detail": "46runs/28站 amazon_us+4价格 SPEC站无product_url不可用", "s1_keyword_search": "44runs/16站 amazon_us+39 samsung_bo+40 hisense_co+37", "s4_reviews": "57runs/20站 costco_us+72 Amazon被not_logged_in拦", "data_quality_fix": "kakaku_jp13条空价从raw_text解析円/异常币种37条DEL/空币种46条按站补/running35条标completed"}, "solution": {"step_order": "SPEC先行(23站全量)->S2型号传递(151站)->S3详情直采(有产品缺价格)->S1关键词补全(宽关键词)->S4网评增量", "s1_keywords": "Samsung TV/LG TV(2个关键词,每站limit=20,pages=2)", "spec_models_transfer": "1687型号库全球通用 samsung537/hisense342/lg244/tcl222/regza139/sony109"}, "result": {"spec_row": "80878->113390(+32512)", "price": "11220->11303(+83)", "review": "84023->84095(+72)", "product": "13312->13440(+128)", "sites_with_price": "112->124(+12)", "waf_blocked_sites": "~35(captcha/403/503/not_logged_in/timeout)"}, "lesson": "全量抓取最优路径: SPEC先抓(型号库全局复用)->S1关键词搜索是补价主力(比S2型号搜索匹配率高)->S3仅适用有product_url的零售站->S4网评需登录态(Amazon全系列被拦)->数据质量修复kakaku_jp从raw_text解析円价格+异常币种清理+空币种按站补. 熔断四层(S1/S2/S3/S4)全程有效避免空转.", "playbook": "single_shop.md"}
{"code": "_batch_probe_51", "entry_url": "51 L2 sites (overseas/sites/*/adapter.py 缺 schema.json)", "date": "2026-09-26", "verdict": "blocked", "signals": {"method": "BrowserFetcher.page search_url(TV), nav_timeout=12s, settle=1.5s, serial 1s interval, rebuild fetcher every 5", "waf_breakdown": "Cloudflare=18, http_403_ip_block=12, DataDome=4(fnac_fr/fnac_pt/darty_fr + eBay), F5/Shape=3(datart_cz/datart_sk/nay_sk fake-200), Vercel=3(elgiganten_se/elkjop_no/gigantti_fi 429), Akamai=1(emag_bg 511), status_404_url_wrong=6(boulanger_fr/but_fr/electrodepot_fr/ebay_de/euronics_it/trony_it), timeout_-1=5(hisense_bo/hisense_ec/kotsovolos_gr/radiopopular_pt/tcl_ec), empty_200=3(sonvideo_fr/public_gr/trendyol_tr SPA软封)"}, "solution": {"note": "0/51 站建 schema.json: 全部被 WAF 硬封或 SPA 软封(200 但 0 产品)。WAF 硬封按 IP/ASN 拦, BrowserFetcher+stealth+proxy 不过, 需住宅 IP。SPA 软封(networkidle+6滚动+6s等待仍 0 产品)同理。不建 schema 符合缺价>错价原则。"}, "result": {"fixed_schema": 0, "blocked_waf": 48, "no_results_spa": 3, "total": 51, "caveat": "sonvideo_fr 200+100KB 但搜索页只渲染促销卡无产品; public_gr 1MB SPA 仅渲染 header/cookie 横幅; trendyol_tr React SPA networkidle 仍 0 产品。三站均 soft-block 对代理 IP 不渲染产品。"}, "lesson": "51 个缺 schema 的 L2 站在当前机房代理(127.0.0.1:7877)出口下 100% 不可用: 45 站 WAF 硬封(Cloudflare/DataDome/F5/Vercel/Akamai/http403), 6 站 URL 404 需重探路径, 3 站 SPA 软封(200 但 0 产品, networkidle+长等待仍空)。补建 schema.json 需先换住宅 IP 让搜索页可达出产品。批量探测有效信号: datart_cz/sk/nay_sk 是 F5 假 200(空 title+/TSPD/), elgiganten/elkjop/gigantti 是 Vercel 429 检查点, emag_bg 511 是 Akamai captcha。", "playbook": "needs_residential_ip"}
{"code": "eu_category_page_29sites_probe", "entry_url": "(29 站分类页型探测，见 _probe29_results.json)", "date": "2026-09-26", "verdict": "blocked", "signals": {"scope": "29 个 search_url 为分类页(非搜索页)且无 search.container 的欧洲零售站", "result_breakdown": "WAF硬封19 / URL失效404-400共6 / SPA可达但无产品2 / 网络错误-1共2 / 可修复0", "waf_types": {"cloudflare": ["conforama_fr", "foxtrot_ua", "mediamarkt_nl", "mediamarkt_tr", "rozetka_ua", "teknosa_tr", "vatan_tr", "worten_pt"], "http_403_direct": ["bol_be", "bol_nl", "but_fr", "carrefour_fr(403+574KB软403)", "eprice_it", "hepsiburada_tr(Güvenlik)", "kotsovolos_gr", "plaisio_gr"], "vercel_429": ["elgiganten_se", "elkjop_no"], "maintenance": ["fnac_pt(FNAC DARTY - Maintenance)"], "access_denied": ["eprice_it", "kotsovolos_gr", "plaisio_gr"]}, "url_wrong": {"boulanger_fr": "HTTP400 Invalid URL(/c/televiseurs)", "electrodepot_fr": "404", "euronics_it": "404 Salesforce Sites-euronics-Site", "radiopopular_pt": "404", "rueducommerce_fr": "404", "trony_it": "404 软404跳首页"}, "spa_no_product": {"komplett_se": "200+799KB 但0商品链接(article=4为框架元素,需API/更多渲染)", "leclerc_fr": "200+122KB 但0商品链接(SPA/API加载)"}, "net_error_retry_possible": ["brack_ch", "power_se(trony_it,carrefour_fr,komplett_se,leclerc_fr 并行复测可达,代理不稳)"], "heuristic": "严格评分:卡片需同时含商品链接(product slug正则)+价格文本,>=3卡且分>=4.0才算可建container;防选到导航/框架元素"}, "solution": {"no_container_built": "0 站补建 search.container(全部不可达或无产品),29站 schema.json/retail.json 均未改(保持blocked)", "principle": "缺价 > 错价:不确定的选择器宁可不配,不因有container就激活", "next_steps": "WAF站需住宅IP/代理切换;URL错站需人工查正确分类URL;SPA站需逆向API或更多渲染交互"}, "result": {"fixable": 0, "not_fixable_via_category_url": 29, "probe_runtime_s": 403, "visits_per_site": 1, "results_file": "_probe29_results.json"}, "lesson": "欧洲零售站分类页(/televiseurs /televizyonlar /tv 等)普遍被 Cloudflare/Vercel/Akamai 硬封或为 SPA(商品靠 API 加载,首屏无卡片)。分类页型 search_url 几乎无法直接补建 search.container——应优先走 sitemap_discovery 或逆向商品 API,而非试图从分类页 DOM 抽卡片。探测器必须严格区分 WAF/URL错/SPA,且不可因 HTML 大就判可达(如 carrefour_fr 403+574KB、trony_it 404+367KB 均为软封/软404)。", "playbook": ""}
{"code": "_deepresearch_report_6agent", "entry_url": "(overseas/report/generate_report.py)", "date": "2026-09-28", "verdict": "success", "signals": {"architecture": "6 Agent: ChiefArchitect(规划)→DataScout(采集+信源标注)→DataAnalyst(分析)→CompetitorAnalyst(对手/预警)→ReportWriter(撰写)→CriticMaster(审核+幻觉检测)", "anti_hallucination": "6措施: 数据锚定/信源追溯[来源:Sx]/事实约束/对抗审核/数值校验/引用格式", "report_dimensions": "市场总览→数据分析→对手分析→未来报告→其他厂家上市预警→其他厂家活动预警→数据缺口与后续抓取建议→信源索引"}, "solution": {"agents": "每个Agent封装为类，CriticMaster做对抗审核+质量评分(1-10分制)", "source_tracing": "每条数据标注信源ID+表名+站点+周+可信度(0-1)，DB直采=1.0", "fcc_plan": "后续抓取FCC认证信息(fccid.io)提前2-6月预警新品上市"}, "result": {"stats": "13,507产品/146,853规格/11,817价格/84,095评价→16,457字报告，244信源", "review_score": "8.0/10，0 critical，2 major", "alerts": "上市预警30个(HIGH) + 活动预警20个(10个高波动>30%)"}, "lesson": "6-Agent架构有效减少大模型幻觉: 每个结论锚定DB真实数据+信源ID，CriticMaster对抗审核检测无数据支撑的百分比。报告自动生成9章(含FCC后续抓取方案+数据缺口清单)。classify_region()修复后区域汇总表准确。", "playbook": "(OPS运维)"}
{"code": "_langgraph_parallel_retail", "entry_url": "(overseas/flow/nodes/retail_monitor.py)", "date": "2026-09-28", "verdict": "success", "signals": {"serial_bottleneck": "66站RETAIL串行每站90s超时→总耗时99min；并行度3→33min", "sqlite_threading": "子进程隔离(subprocess.run)而非threading，避免SQLite线程冲突", "progress_display": "ThreadPoolExecutor+as_completed实时输出完成站(✅/⏱/❌图标+耗时)"}, "solution": {"parallel": "ThreadPoolExecutor(max_workers=3) + as_completed收集", "subprocess": "每站独立subprocess.run([PY,-c,script]) + 独立DB连接", "config": "state['parallel_workers']=3可动态调整"}, "result": {"japan_retail": "1站kakaku_jp超时90s(代理慢)", "eu_retail": "66站57超时7无效URL2成功(amazon_de/uk)", "total_speedup": "并行后RETAIL阶段总耗时≈串行/3"}, "lesson": "RETAIL并行度=3最优(子进程轻量90s)，再高会触发代理限速。每站独立子进程避免SQLite线程冲突是关键。as_completed让用户看到实时进度而非等全部完成。", "playbook": "(OPS运维)"}
{"code": "_monitor_from_db_url_fix", "entry_url": "(overseas/scenarios.py s2_monitor_known)", "date": "2026-09-28", "verdict": "success", "signals": {"symptom": "monitor --from-db 全部失败 'Cannot navigate to invalid URL'", "root_cause": "s2_monitor_known 用 row['sku'] 传给 collect_detail，但多数站点 sku 是纯数字ID不是URL，adapter.product_url(sku) 也无法还原完整URL", "affected_sites": "tcl_uk/bol_be/bol_nl/interdiscount_ch/expert_de/exito_co/euronics_ee 等所有sku为数字ID的站点"}, "solution": {"fix": "scenarios.py s2_monitor_known: 优先用 row['url'](DB product.url列) 作为URL，仅在url为空时回退到 adapter.product_url(sku)", "code": "db_url = row['url'] if 'url' in row.keys() else ''; if db_url and str(db_url).startswith('http'): sku = db_url"}, "result": {"before": "tcl_uk 0/118 价格(hisense_co 27/96), lg_ec 13/22, credivargas_pe 45/53, tcl_cl 21/30, max_gt 54/59, amazon_fr 31/37", "after": "tcl_uk 1/120(品牌官网无价), hisense_co 94/157(+32%), lg_ec 22/22(100%), credivargas_pe 89/104, tcl_cl 36/45(+10%), max_gt 55/60, amazon_fr 66/73(+7%)", "sites_blocked_by_waf_or_proxy": "bestbuy_ca(403), bestbuy_us/altex_ro(ERR_HTTP2_PROTOCOL_ERROR), eprice_it(403), canadiantire_ca(全部timeout)", "sites_price_selector_broken": "exito_co/euronics_ee/power_dk/expert_de/philips_de/tcl_uk: 页面加载OK但price=None, 需更新RetailSpec price选择器"}, "lesson": "monitor --from-db 必须用DB的product.url列而非sku列作为URL来源。sku是站内ID(常为纯数字),product_url()仅适用于搜索流程发现的SKU(已含URL前缀)。修复后多个站点价格覆盖率从0%提升到50-100%。但price=None的站点(exito_co/euronics_ee/power_dk)是选择器过时问题,需单独修RetailSpec。"}
{"code": "_flat_price_schema_fix", "entry_url": "exito_co/euronics_ee/power_dk + 64站点扫描", "date": "2026-09-28", "verdict": "success", "signals": {"symptom": "monitor --from-db 页面200但price=None", "root_cause": "schema.json price段扁平结构(selectors直接在price下),Extractor期望嵌套(price.price.selectors)", "affected": "64个站点扫描发现扁平结构,12个有产品且价格<90%"}, "solution": {"approach": "扁平price段→嵌套结构: price.price/currency/list_price/raw_text子对象", "exito_co": "加price_fs-price选择器+priceSection_container-promotion_price-dashed划线价", "euronics_ee": "扁平→嵌套,价格选择器[class*='price']命中191.99EUR", "power_dk": "同euronics_ee,DKK货币", "bol_be/bol_nl/interdiscount_ch/pigu_lt": "结构已修但WAF 403封锁"}, "result": {"exito_co": "2413/2592有价(93%),179条推荐栏污染价格已删除", "euronics_ee": "3/3有价(2059/4299/2883EUR),全量300正在抓", "flat_sites_fixed": "interdiscount_ch/bol_be/bol_nl/philips_de/pigu_lt/comfy_ua/megamaxi_ec 结构已修"}, "lesson": "price=None但页面200→先查schema.json price段是否扁平(selectors直接在price下而非price.price下)。Extractor的fields()遍历price段的key生成字段,扁平结构没有'price'字段名→prf.get('price')=None。64个站点有此问题,是批量schema生成的系统性缺陷。修复:扁平price→嵌套price.price/currency/list_price/raw_text四子对象。"}
{"code": "_kakaku_jp_price_selector", "entry_url": "kakaku.com/item/K0001787488/", "date": "2026-09-28", "verdict": "success", "signals": {"symptom": "213条price=None但raw_text='474,877 円～'(有价格文本)", "root_cause": "schema price选择器.p-lowestPrice已失效(页面改版,该class不存在,count=0)", "new_structure": "最低价在.p-prdInfoLowprice_entity(1个元素)或.p-priceList_priceMain(第一个=最低价,按价格排序)"}, "solution": {"approach": "更新price选择器列表,加入新class,保留旧选择器做fallback", "selector_added": ".p-prdInfoLowprice_entity + .p-priceList_priceMain + .p-lowestPrice(旧)"}, "result": {"before": "316/380有价(83%),213条price=None有raw_text", "test": "10/10全部有价(255691~853506 JPY)", "expected_after": "~340/380有价(89%),剩余~40条=已下架无店铺商品(price元素不存在)"}, "lesson": "price=None但raw_text有价格文本→price选择器找到了错误元素(空文本),raw_text选择器[class*='price']更宽泛所以找到了文本。修复:检查页面DOM确认选择器是否仍存在,更新为新class。価格.com的price=None产品=已下架(无店铺在售),.p-prdInfoLowprice_entity count=0,页面含'価格情報'关键字,这是正常现象不是bug。"}
{"code": "_megamaxi_ec_jsonld", "entry_url": "megamaxi.com/producto/tv-led-google-ey32chiq-m8g-engy-32/", "date": "2026-09-28", "verdict": "success", "signals": {"symptom": "price=None或price=10.0(折扣文本-10%被解析)", "root_cause": "schema price.jsonld=false(禁用了JSON-LD兜底),[class*='price']匹配到容器元素返回空文本或折扣徽章", "jsonld_data": "页面有JSON-LD Product type,offers.price=189.99正确"}, "solution": {"approach": "启用jsonld=offers.price兜底,加具体选择器.cf_api_product_price/.cf_api_regular_price", "fix": "price.jsonld: false→offers.price, selectors加.cf_api_product_price在前"}, "result": {"before": "87%(3无价),price=10.0错误", "after": "97%(1无价),189.99/387.99/622.19/1440.99等真实价格"}, "lesson": "jsonld=false会禁用JSON-LD兜底→当CSS选择器匹配到错误元素(空文本/折扣徽章)时无fallback。修复:启用jsonld=offers.price+加具体class选择器在前。WooCommerce站(cf_api_product_price)常有JSON-LD Product数据可用。"}
{"code": "_batch_flat_jsonld_fix", "entry_url": "global scan 64 sites", "date": "2026-09-29", "verdict": "success", "signals": {"symptom": "多站点price=None或price=错误值(折扣文本/推荐栏),全局覆盖率<70%", "root_cause": "schema生成器系统性缺陷:1)扁平price结构(selectors在price下非price.price)→extractor的fields()不生成price字段 2)jsonld=false禁用JSON-LD兜底→CSS选择器匹配错误元素时无fallback"}, "solution": {"approach": "全局扫描所有schema.json→分类(扁平/JSONLD_FALSE)→批量修复→补抓验证", "scan_script": "for code in sites: check price.selectors flat or price.price.jsonld==false", "fix_flat": "price.selectors→price.price.selectors + 补currency/list_price/raw_text子对象", "fix_jsonld": "price.price.jsonld: false→offers.price", "fix_selector": "加具体class(如.cf_api_product_price)在通用[class*=price]前面"}, "result": {"before": "全局67.8%,北美47.5%,欧洲84.2%,南美70.1%", "after": "修复47站schema,补抓8站验证:amazon_nl95%/amazon_tr97%/power_no98%/megamaxi97%", "unfixable": "WAF 403(bol_be等5站)+HTTP2(altex_ro)+SSR(exito_co)+品牌官网不卖(hisense_pe等3站)"}, "lesson": "新站接入后必须monitor --from-db验证价格提取,price=None+页面200优先查schema扁平结构/jsonld=false。全局扫描脚本一次找完所有缺陷,比逐站诊断高效。"}
