{"code": "amazon_us_price_currency_fix", "entry_url": "amazon_us monitor --models-file (SPEC型号驱动零售抓取)", "date": "2026-10-06", "verdict": "partial", "signals": {"scope": "用SPEC型号清单(samsung_us 46/sony_us 61/lg_us 100/tcl_us 47/hisense_us 179)驱动amazon_us monitor搜索+价格抓取", "match_rate": "Samsung 76%(35/46) Sony 87%(53/61) LG 44%(44/100) TCL 85%(40/47) Hisense 47%(85/179) — 短型号(Hisense/LG)匹配率低因Amazon搜到配件", "price_anomaly": "raw_text='$2,49500'被t_money解析为249500(应为$2,495.00) — Amazon非美国IP偶发渲染'¥249,500'→'$2,49500'(逗号替代小数点); raw_text='$99999'(无小数点)应为$999.99", "currency_bug": "t_currency行72-73把裸$当CAD(面向加拿大站), amazon_us应为USD — 需currency_us transform", "review_gap": "monitor命令want_reviews=False(scenarios.py:391), reviews_new=0, 409产品无网评", "no_anchor_intermittent": "Amazon搜索页div[data-asin]锚点间歇性不渲染, 连续3次触发熔断跳过剩余型号"}, "solution": {"currency_fix": "extract.py新增t_currency_us(裸$→USD), 注册到TRANSFORMS, amazon_us schema.json currency transform改为currency_us", "money_fix": "t_money新增: (1)¥/￥符号→return None跳过(缺价>错价); (2)逗号后跟5位数字(如2,49500)→拆为XXXX.XX(逗号千分位+末2位小数)", "db_cleanup": "3步DB修复: (1)raw_text重新解析price+currency改为USD (2)删除>$50000错误价格55条 (3)无小数点5位数字($49797→$497.97)修正34条", "batch_strategy": "分批次跑(每批15型号), kill chrome+wait 5s between batches, 避免no_anchor_element熔断", "model_prefix": "短型号(Hisense 100E6QF/LG 27LX6TYGA)搜Amazon会匹配配件, 应加品牌前缀搜索'Hisense 100E6QF'而非'100E6QF'"}, "result": {"before": "amazon_us 241产品 285价格 793网评 currency=CAD(错)", "after": "amazon_us 409产品 487价格 793网评 currency=USD(修) avg=$1062 max=$13997(TCL 115\") min=$6.10", "price_range_fixed": "修前max=$249500(日元误读) → 修后max=$13997.99(真实旗舰价格)", "deleted_wrong": "55条>$50000错误价格删除, 34条5位无小数点价格修正"}, "lesson": "Amazon非美国IP渲染bug: (1)¥→$符号替换 (2)小数点丢失($999.99→$99999) (3)逗号替代小数点($2,495.00→$2,49500). t_currency裸$=CAD影响所有US站. t_money需防御¥符号和异常格式. monitor不抓网评需单独跑reviews命令. 短型号需加品牌前缀搜索减少配件误匹配.", "playbook": "single_shop"}
