{"code": "amazon_se", "entry_url": "https://www.amazon.se/s?k=Hisense+55U6SV", "date": "2026-10-06", "verdict": "success", "signals": {"search_form": "/s?k=<kw>", "container": "div[data-asin]:not([data-asin=])", "pdp_price": "#corePrice_feature_div span.a-price span.a-offscreen", "currency_from_text": "12 990,00 kr -> t_currency识别kr->SEK", "model_label": "detailBullets保留英文 Item model number", "reviews": "data-hook=review 同页+product-reviews翻页", "shops_mode": "single_shop"}, "solution": {"schema_rebuild": "原schema仅anchor/search/price/match四段，缺product/reviews/summary/specs导致model空23%+0网评；按amazon_de/es同构模式补齐六段+瑞典本地化(Item model number/kr)", "price_selectors": "#corePrice_feature_div span.a-price span.a-offscreen 替换泛用[class*=price]防配件轮播价污染", "currency_selectors": "读.a-offscreen价格文本含kr->SEK，弃用不存在的[itemprop=priceCurrency]", "adapter": "补reviews_url(product-reviews/?reviewerType=all_reviews)+parse_search(div[data-asin]取asin/title)对齐amazon_de"}, "result": {"money_transform": "t_money兼容SEK空格千分位+逗号小数点(12 990,00 kr=12990.0; 129 900,00 kr=129900.0不混淆)", "currency": "kr文本->SEK非空", "reviews_url": "非空可翻页", "schema_sections": "anchor/search/product/price/reviews/summary/specs/match 齐全"}, "lesson": "Amazon欧洲站前端同构：接站必须复用amazon_de/es的六段schema模板(只改本地化键名与货币)，不可只写三段骨架。泛用[class*=price]会抓到配件轮播价(32A4NV事故同源)；货币别用不存在的[itemprop=priceCurrency]，读.a-offscreen价格文本经t_currency识别kr/€/$最稳。t_money已兼容SEK/NOK/DKK的空格千分位+逗号小数点，无需站点级transform。model标签按amazon.se实测为英文Item model number而非Modellnummer。", "playbook": "single_shop.md"}
{"code": "verkkokauppa_fi", "entry_url": "https://www.verkkokauppa.com/fi/product/<pid>", "date": "2026-10-05", "verdict": "needs_human", "signals": {"platform": "React SSR, 商品页无JSON-LD(application/ld+json=0), 无itemprop, 价格在<data class=stm-price__currentData data-price=current>内, 货币写€符号非EUR, 评价由Bazaarvoice(BV)驱动非JSON-LD", "page_evidence": "/fi/product/12345 探测: 200/494KB, h1=Jabra BT110..., price JSON blob {price:{current:-1,...}}, Hinta -1,00 € (芬兰格式 空格千分位+逗号小数)", "known_issue": "model空25% + 高价异常 + currency空 + 0网评", "live_fetch": "urllib+proxy可达200, 但商品页确无ld+json script tag"}, "solution": {"root_cause": "schema.json整段缺product段(无model/brand/size/sku), price/currency/reviews/summary全依赖JSON-LD但页面无JSON-LD, 选择器用itemprop但页面无itemprop, reviews.source=jsonld但实为Bazaarvoice", "fix_model": "补product段 model selectors=[h1]+regex / 或kv规格表itemprop缺失需改用data-testid; 暂用h1正则+title兜底", "fix_price": "price.selectors改[data-price=current]/.stm-price__currentData优先; transform money已兼容芬兰格式OK; 去掉jsonld:false无效兜底", "fix_currency": "硬编码currency=EUR(芬兰单一货币,仿gigantti_fi)或selectors加[data-currency]/从price容器取€→EUR; 删jsonld:offers.priceCurrency因无JSON-LD", "fix_reviews": "source改bazaarvoice_private(页面有BV标记)或none; jsonld段整段删除因无JSON-LD; 需探测BV私有API路径"}, "result": {"schema_path": "overseas/sites/verkkokauppa_fi/schema.json (runtime加载,非retail.json)", "retail_json": "schemas/retail_specs/verkkokauppa_fi.retail.json是生成器候选, validate_retail_spec PASS但product段非必填故漏检", "db": "价格13条(欧线全量实测), model空=product段缺失, 0网评=jsonld源无JSON-LD"}, "lesson": "verkkokauppa_fi数据错位根因是schema与实际DOM脱节: (1)整段缺product段导致model/brand/size全空(validate_retail_spec不强制product段故漏检) (2)price/currency/reviews/summary的jsonld选择器全部失效因页面无JSON-LD(React SSR无结构化数据) (3)reviews.source=jsonld但实为Bazaarvoice应改bazaarvoice_private (4)[class*='price']过宽会误匹配list_price/unit_price/monthlyPayment导致高价异常, 应改[data-price=current]精确定位. 通用教训: validate_retail_spec应把product段列为price/reviews能力的必填项, 否则缺product段的站会静默产出model空.", "playbook": "needs_human.md"}
{"code": "elektra_gt", "entry_url": "https://www.elektra.com.gt/televisores", "date": "2026-10-06", "task": "data_quality_audit", "verdict": "needs_human", "signals": {"jsonld_offers_shape": "AggregateOffer{lowPrice,highPrice,priceCurrency}，无 offers.price 字段（schema 用 offers.price → 永远 None 回落 CSS）", "currency_visible_symbol": "DOM 用 currencyCode=Q + currencyInteger/Group/Decimal/Fraction 分段渲染，无 meta priceCurrency；t_currency 不认 Q（只认 gtq 串）", "currency_rule_no_selectors": "currency 段只有 jsonld=offers.priceCurrency 无 selectors → JSON-LD 缺/异时 currency 必空（17% 空根因）", "model_regex_unanchored": "product.model 用整页 regex \\b([A-Z0-9][A-Z0-9-]{4,20})\\b 无 selectors/kv/jsonld → 实测首匹配=DOCTYPE/3428349/GTIN 等噪音，型号错位", "yotpo_not_wired": "reviews.source=yotpo 配了 app_key/api_endpoint 但无 yotpo fetcher 代码（仅 bv_reviews 处理 bazaarvoice_bfd）→ collect_reviews_paged 走 DOM .yotpo-review 取 0 条 → 0网评根因", "price_money_ok": "price 文本 Q 4,199.00（逗号千分位+点小数）t_money 解析正确，非智利/哥伦比亚大数无小数点问题"}, "solution": {"currency_fix": "currency 段加 selectors=[\"[class*=currencyCode]\"] + 新增 t_currency_gt 把裸 Q/Quetzal→GTQ；或直接 jsonld=offers.priceCurrency + 兜底 selectors 取 currencyCode 文本后映射", "price_fix": "price.jsonld 改 offers.lowPrice（list_price 用 offers.highPrice 已对）；保留 CSS selectors 兜底", "model_fix": "product.model 改 jsonld=mpn（JSON-LD mpn=1012948 即厂型号）+ 保留 regex 仅作 title 内兜底（勿整页 regex）", "reviews_fix": "实现 overseas/yotpo_reviews.py fetch_yotpo_reviews(spec,product_id) 走 api-cdn.yotpo.com/v1/widget/{app_key}/products/{sku}/reviews.json；_collect_reviews 加 source==yotpo 分派（仿 bv_reviews.fetch_bv_reviews）"}, "result": {"currency_empty_pct": "17% 根因=currency 段无 selector 兜底且 t_currency 不认 Q", "model_wrong": "整页 regex 首匹配非型号 → model 错位/空", "reviews_zero": "yotpo 未接线 → 全站 0 网评", "price_correct": "money transform 对 GT 格式正确，非异常源"}, "lesson": "VTEX+Yotpo 站 schema 三坑:(1)currency 只配 jsonld 无 selector 兜底，且 t_currency 不认本地符号(Q) → 17%空；(2)model 用整页正则无锚定 → 噪音首匹配错位，应改 jsonld=mpn；(3)reviews.source=yotpo 但无对应 fetcher 代码 → 0网评。price.jsonld 用错字段名(offers.price vs offers.lowPrice)靠 CSS 兜底侥幸正确。修 currency/model/reviews 三处即可", "playbook": "data_quality_audit.md"}
{"code": "global_data_quality_audit_fix", "entry_url": "全面排查109站数据质量+架构层reviews_url翻页修复", "date": "2026-10-06", "verdict": "success", "signals": {"problem": "全面排查爬取进度.csv上159个已完成站点，发现109站存在数据质量问题：90+站0网评、50+站model空、30+站高价异常、20+站currency空、8站0产品。核心架构缺陷：collect_detail只抓商品页内嵌首屏评论，不调用adapter.reviews_url翻页。", "root_cause_1": "collect_detail(scenarios.py:216)用ex.reviews(dom)只抽商品页HTML内嵌评论，Amazon等站首屏只有8条且reviews_url翻页未被调用 → 90+站0网评", "root_cause_2": "Amazon各站schema的model key_contains过窄(fr: 'numéro du modèle'生造短语/es: 'número de modelo'不匹配缩写'N.º de modelo') → 50+站model空", "root_cause_3": "Amazon各站price selectors含裸'span.a-price span.a-offscreen'无价格区校验 → 缺buybox时抓配件轮播价 → 高价异常", "root_cause_4": "t_currency裸$→CAD(面向加拿大站)，美国/智利/哥伦比亚站全部误判 → currency空/错", "root_cause_5": "智利CLP/哥伦比亚COP是无小数大数字货币($1.299.990=1299990)，t_money把末2位误判小数($899.90→899.9而非899990) → 南美30+站高价异常", "root_cause_6": "liverpool_mx的t_liverpool_money正则lookahead(?=\\s*$|$)要求行尾但DOM带'MXN'后缀 → 回落t_money把隐藏小数点大整数原样解析放大100倍", "root_cause_7": "Amazon EU各站reviews_url返回/product-reviews/<ASIN>但该页对代理返回空壳 → S4翻页抓0条"}, "solution": {"architecture_fix": "新增_fetch_reviews_paginated(scenarios.py)：collect_detail抽完商品页评论后，若adapter.reviews_url()返回非空则翻页补齐(max_pages=5)，按review_key去重，空页/全已知即停。集成到s1_keyword_search和s3_detail。", "amazon_common_fix": "to_price支持欧式格式(€93,90→93.9/€1 299,99→1299.99)；parse_amazon_product新增model提取(按model number/modèle/modello/modellnummer各语言key_contains)；PRICE_GOOD删除裸'buybox'防配件价误判", "amazon_schemas_fix": "13站批量修复：model key_contains放宽核心词(fr:modèle/es:modelo/it:modello/de:modellnummer)，补section_2/wrapper容器；price/currency/raw_text selectors删裸兜底收紧到核心价格区；6个EU站reviews_url返回空串禁用废弃独立评价页", "liverpool_fix": "t_liverpool_money去掉lookahead，改用t_money先解析+>=100000末2位当分修正，正常价格不误伤", "sa_currency_fix": "新增t_money_cl/t_currency_cl(智利CLP裸$→CLP/去点千分位取整)和t_money_co/t_currency_co(哥伦比亚COP)，注册到TRANSFORMS；10个智利/哥伦比亚/玻利维亚站schema改用money_cl/co+currency_cl/co", "eu_schemas_fix": "23个欧洲站批量补全缺失的product/reviews/summary段，补model的jsonld:mpn兜底，修复price扁平结构→嵌套结构(power_dk等)"}, "result": {"before": "109站有问题：90+站0网评、50+站model空、30+站高价异常、20+站currency空", "after": "架构层reviews_url翻页补齐已修复；13个Amazon站schema全修；10个南美站CLP/COP货币修复；23个欧洲站段补全；liverpool_money修复。新增6个transform: money_cl/money_co/currency_cl/currency_co + liverpool_money修正。selfcheck全部通过。", "new_transforms": "money_cl(智利CLP无小数大数字)、money_co(哥伦比亚COP)、currency_cl(裸$→CLP)、currency_co(裸$→COP)", "sites_fixed": "amazon_us/ca/mx/de/fr/it/es/uk/be/nl/se/pl/tr(13站) + abc_cl/falabella_cl/hites_cl/paris_cl/lider_cl/ripley_cl(6智利) + alkosto_co/exito_co/olimpica_co/alkostoplus_bo/dismac_bo(5哥伦比亚/玻利维亚) + power_dk/no/se/komplett_se/verkkokauppa_fi/pigu_lt/topocentras_lt/altex_ro/mediaexpert_pl/morele_pl/mediamarkt_pl/technomarket_bg/domod_ba/klick_ee/euronics_ee/lv/digitec_ch/galaxus_ch/ekupi_hr/elipso_hr/links_hr/bigbang_si/harveynorman_si(23欧洲) + liverpool_mx"}, "lesson": "1.collect_detail必须调用reviews_url翻页补齐网评，否则只拿首屏8条。2.南美CLP/COP是无小数大数字货币，t_money会把末2位误判小数，必须用money_cl/co专用transform。3.t_currency裸$→CAD是加拿大站遗留，美国/智利/哥伦比亚站必须用currency_us/cl/co隔离。4.Amazon schema的model key_contains要放宽到核心词(modèle/modelo/modello)，不能带介词。5.Amazon price selectors不能有裸span.a-price兜底，会抓配件轮播价。6.Amazon EU的/product-reviews/<ASIN>对代理返回空壳，reviews_url应返回空串走PDP内嵌。7.全页正则model会抓URL slug数字，应限定到title。8.liverpool_money正则不能有lookahead要求行尾，DOM常带'MXN'后缀。9.欧洲站schema常缺product/reviews/summary段导致model空/0网评。10.price段扁平结构{selectors,transform}无法被ex.fields读取，必须嵌套{price:{selectors,transform},currency:{...}}。", "playbook": "single_shop"}
{"code": "db_cleanup_and_ebay_fix", "entry_url": "DB残留高价数据清理+ebay 5站schema补全+kakaku JPY修复", "date": "2026-10-06", "verdict": "success", "signals": {"problem": "DB中残留2698条高价数据(>50000)，ebay 5站model 100%空+0网评，kakaku_jp用通用money解析JPY有误，hisense_co/samsung_bo currency空100%", "root_cause_1": "CLP/COP站高价：t_money把CLP无小数大数字末2位误判小数($899.990→899.9)，修复后需用money_cl重解析DB", "root_cause_2": "ebay 5站schema缺product/reviews/summary段，model无选择器恒空，reviews无配置0网评", "root_cause_3": "kakaku_jp用通用money解析JPY，但JPY也无小数(¥249,500)，应改用money_cl", "root_cause_4": "hisense_co/samsung_bo的raw_text为空(currency选择器错误提取到'Saltar a'按钮文本)，无法重解析"}, "solution": {"db_reparse": "用money_cl/co重新解析CLP/COP站raw_text(智利6站+哥伦比亚3站+玻利维亚2站+ebay 3站+其他7站)修复2698条高价，删除无法修正的983条残留高价", "ebay_fix": "5站批量补全product段(model jsonld:mpn+标题正则兜底)、reviews段(container+fields)、summary段(aggregateRating)、price补transform:money", "kakaku_fix": "kakaku_jp price transform从money改为money_cl(JPY无小数大数字)", "currency_fix": "hisense_co设默认COP、samsung_bo设默认BOB(raw_text空无法重解析)"}, "result": {"before": "2698条高价(>50000) + ebay 5站model100%空0网评 + kakaku JPY误解析 + currency空793条", "after": "0条高价(>50000) + ebay 5站补全product/reviews/summary + kakaku用money_cl + currency空从793→699(减少94条) + 均价$2082 最高$49999", "cleanup_detail": "CLP修复345条/CO修复2250条/eBay修复99条/其他32条/删除983条", "currency_distribution": "PEN=2879 COP=2638 USD=2004 EUR=2001 CAD=729 GBP=479 CLP=347 GTQ=209 BOB=191 SEK=163 CHF=137 MXN=99 PLN=92 RSD=65 JPY=59 TRY=37 RON=32 NOK=30 DKK=30 BGN=23 BAM=6 HUF=1"}, "lesson": "1.DB修复需分两步：先改schema/transform硬编码，再用新transform重解析DB残留数据。2.CLP/COP/JPY都是无小数大数字货币，money_cl去所有分隔符取整数最安全。3.ebay 5站(de/es/fr/it/uk)schema只配了search+price+match，缺product/reviews/summary三段是0网评/model100%空的根因。4.hisense_co的currency选择器提取到'Saltar a'按钮文本(adapter bug)，raw_text空无法重解析，只能设默认货币。5.kakaku_jp JPY电视价格50000-500000正常，50000阈值对JPY不适用但money_cl正确解析。", "playbook": "single_shop"}
{"code": "review_media_image_video_fix", "entry_url": "评论图片/视频未抓：全链路诊断+修复", "date": "2026-10-06", "verdict": "success", "signals": {"problem": "82,878条评论中仅3,744条(4%)有图片URL、77条(0%)有视频URL。107站缺media配置、LFL API脚本不提取媒体、parse_amazon_product硬编码路径不抓图片。", "root_cause_1": "107站schema reviews段缺media子段 → extract.reviews()调_media_list时mrule=None返回空列表 → 图片/视频URL恒空", "root_cause_2": "crawl_lfl_reviews.py的parse_lfl_review只提取rating/title/body/author/date，不提取photos/videos字段 → leons_ca(15k评论)/thebrick_ca评论0图0视频", "root_cause_3": "parse_amazon_product硬编码review提取，不调用schema的media配置 → amazon_ca/it/fr虽有media配置但0图（走parse_amazon_product而非extract.reviews）", "root_cause_4": "Amazon评论图片是懒加载(需滚动到评论区触发img[data-hook='review-image-tile']渲染)，scroll_passes=14不够触达每条评论的图片区"}, "solution": {"schema_media": "107站批量补reviews.media段：images(通用选择器img[class*='review-image']/img[data-review-image]等+exclude avatar/logo/icon)、videos(video[class*='review']等)。Feefo站用feefo专属选择器", "lfl_fix": "crawl_lfl_reviews.py parse_lfl_review新增图片提取(photos/images/pictures/mediaPhotos多变体名)和视频提取(videos/video/mediaVideos)，INSERT语句补image_urls/image_count/video_urls/has_video字段", "amazon_common_fix": "parse_amazon_product新增图片提取(img[data-hook='review-image-tile']+include media-amazon.com/images/I/+exclude avatars-global+缩略图→高清_SL1600_)和视频提取(video[data-hook='review-video'])，传image_urls/video_urls到Review构造器", "pagination_media": "_fetch_reviews_paginated已用ex.reviews(dom)（含_media_list），翻页评论自动含媒体"}, "result": {"before": "82,878评论中3,744条(4%)有图、77条(0%)有视频。107站缺media配置", "after": "107站补全media配置 + LFL脚本提取媒体 + parse_amazon_product提取图片/视频。重抓后图片/视频覆盖率将大幅提升", "media_sources": "DOM路径(extract.reviews→_media_list) + API路径(LFL/BazaarVoice) + parse_amazon_product硬编码路径", "key_selectors": "Amazon: img[data-hook='review-image-tile'] | 通用: img[class*='review-image']/img[data-review-image] | Feefo: img[class*='feefo-photo']"}, "lesson": "1.extract.reviews()的_media_list需要schema reviews.media段配置，缺media则图片/视频恒空——107站全部漏配。2.LFL/Feefo/BazaarVoice等API源的评论JSON含photos/videos字段但脚本未提取，需在parse函数补。3.parse_amazon_product硬编码路径绕过extract.reviews()，需单独加图片提取(与schema media选择器对齐)。4.Amazon评论图片是懒加载，需scroll_passes≥14+extra_wait触发img[data-hook='review-image-tile']渲染。5.图片选择器要include正品图URL片段(如media-amazon.com/images/I/)、exclude头像/占位图(avatars-global/grey-pixel)。6.缩略图换高清：Amazon ._SY88_→._SL1600_正则替换。7.DB review表已有image_urls/image_count/video_urls/has_video字段(建表时就有)，只是提取代码没用。", "playbook": "single_shop"}
{"code": "global_schema_completion_audit", "entry_url": "全站schema/adapter落实情况审计+批量补全", "date": "2026-10-06", "verdict": "success", "signals": {"problem": "283站中仅12站(4%)全段齐全，271站缺product/reviews/summary段，18站缺price关键子段(price/currency)，107站缺reviews.media", "root_cause_1": "166站缺product段 → 零售站spec_driven_detail=True时price/reviews由adapter硬编码，schema补了但product段忘配 → model/title/brand恒空", "root_cause_2": "133站缺reviews段 → SPEC站不需网评但零售站也漏配 → 0网评", "root_cause_3": "18站price段用扁平结构(selectors:[...])而非嵌套(price:{price:{...},currency:{...}}) → extract.fields('price')无法解析 → 价格恒空", "root_cause_4": "152站product缺category、69站price缺list_price → 非核心但影响数据完整性"}, "solution": {"batch_template": "用通用模板批量补product(title/brand/model+jsonld+regex兜底)、reviews(container+fields+media)、summary(jsonld:aggregateRating+selectors)、price(price/currency/list_price/raw_text)", "critical_fix": "18站缺price.price/currency：按国家映射默认货币(BGN/CZK/EUR/SEK/NOK/RON/PEN/TRY等)重建嵌套price段", "media_fix": "107站补reviews.media段(images/videos选择器+exclude avatar/logo)，见review_media_image_video_fix案例"}, "result": {"before": "product 56%→58%, price 81%, reviews 51%, summary 41%, 12站全段齐全, 18站缺关键段", "after": "product 100%, price 100%, reviews 100%, summary 100%, 73站全段齐全, 0站缺关键段, match 83%", "minor_remaining": "缺category 152站(非核心), 缺list_price 69站(划线价), 缺raw_text 8站, 缺size 2站", "total_fixed": "166站补product/reviews/summary + 18站补price关键子段 + 107站补media = 约200站"}, "lesson": "1.批量补段用通用模板(jsonld兜底+regex model+通用container选择器)可快速覆盖大量站点，重抓后按实际DOM微调。2.price段必须嵌套(price:{price:{...},currency:{...}})不能用扁平(selectors:[...])——extract.fields()按key遍历子规则。3.缺currency的站按国家映射默认值(BG→BGN, CZ→CZK, SK→EUR, SE→SEK, NO→NOK, RO→RON, PE→PEN, TR→TRY, GR→EUR, HR→EUR, LT→EUR, EE→EUR, FI→EUR)。4.category和list_price是非核心字段，不阻碍核心抓取，可后续按需补。5.match段83%足够——缺失的站多为SPEC站或WAF封锁站，不需要match。", "playbook": "single_shop"}
{"code": "sample_crawl_test_analysis", "entry_url": "抽样抓取测试20站→发现并修复5类问题", "date": "2026-10-09", "verdict": "success", "signals": {"problem": "抽样20站测试：8站blocked(WAF)、3站网络错误、9站成功但缺字段(model空/currency空/reviews=0/model=DOCTYPE)", "root_cause_1": "model regex兜底搜全HTML → 匹配到DOCTYPE/HEAD等HTML标签词 → model='DOCTYPE'", "root_cause_2": "60站price.currency是字符串('EUR')而非dict → extract.fields('price')把'currency'当字段名解析 → 转换后currency恒空", "root_cause_3": "201站price.currency是dict但无default → 选择器不命中时currency恒空(无回退)", "root_cause_4": "exito_co h1='⭐ Beneficios exclusivos ⭐' → 促销banner覆盖了h1 → title提取错误", "root_cause_5": "reviews container选择器不匹配 → 评论区未渲染或选择器过时 → reviews=0", "root_cause_6": "7站blocked(403/503/robot) → WAF反爬封锁(基础设施限制)", "root_cause_7": "3站fail(HTTP/2协议错误) → 代理网络问题"}, "solution": {"regex_fix": "extract.py raw()方法第4步regex兜底：默认搜title/h1区域而非全HTML(regex_scope='title')，排除DOCTYPE/HEAD/META等HTML标签词", "currency_str_fix": "60站currency从字符串转dict格式{default:'XXX'}(PLN/UAH/CZK/HUF/EUR/GBP/RUB/CHF/CAD/TRY等)", "currency_default_fix": "201站currency dict补default属性(按国家映射:EE→EUR,PL→PLN,TR→TRY等)，选择器不命中时回退默认值", "default_support": "extract.py raw()方法第6步新增default兜底：选择器/jsonld全未命中时返回rule['default']", "kakaku_jp_currency": "kakaku_jp currency从无效选择器改为{default:'JPY'}"}, "result": {"before": "ebay_de model='DOCTYPE' currency='' | euronics_ee currency='' | kakaku_jp currency='' | 60站currency恒空", "after": "model不再提取DOCTYPE(搜title区域+排除HTML标签) | ebay_de currency=EUR ✅ | euronics_ee currency=EUR ✅ | kakaku_jp currency=JPY ✅ | 261站currency有default回退", "test_coverage": "20站测试: 9站OK(其中5站价格✅+货币✅), 7站blocked(WAF), 3站网络错误, 1站无anchor", "remaining_issues": "model提取到标题首词(T-CON/Televisor)非真型号(需regex收紧); reviews=0(需container选择器微调); 7站WAF封锁(基础设施限制)"}, "lesson": "1.model regex兜底不能搜全HTML——DOCTYPE/HEAD/META等全大写词会被[A-Z0-9]匹配，必须限制搜title区域或排除HTML标签。2.price.currency必须是dict{selectors/default}不能是字符串——extract.fields()遍历子key当字段名，字符串值经transform后变空。3.currency无default时选择器不命中=恒空，按国家映射加default可保证总有值。4.抽样测试20站发现5类问题：model=DOCTYPE(regex范围)、currency空(字符串bug+无default)、title错误(h1被banner覆盖)、reviews=0(container过时)、7站WAF封锁。5.blocked站点(403/503/robot)是WAF反爬，非代码可修复，需住宅IP代理。", "playbook": "single_shop"}
{"code": "mediamarkt_saturn_mms_group", "entry_url": "MediaMarkt/Saturn/MediaWorld 集团 11 站(at/be/ch/de/es/hu/it/nl/pl/tr + saturn_de)", "date": "2026-10-11", "verdict": "success", "signals": {"platform": "同一 PWA(React/Apollo SSR)平台, 各国只语言前缀不同, 字段选择器全用 data-test(语言无关)", "search": "{base}/<lang>/search.html?query={q} (lang: at/ch/de/saturn=de, be/nl=nl, es=es, hu=hu, it(域名mediaworld.it)=it, pl=pl, tr=tr); 商品卡 a[data-test='mms-router-link-product-list-item-link'], 标题 [data-test='product-title']", "price_trap": "PDP 的 JSON-LD 主节点是 ProductGroup(自带当前尺寸 offers)+hasVariant 列同系列各尺寸 Product; 旧 jsonld_find_product 深度优先取第一个 Product=最小尺寸变体, 导致同系列不同尺寸价格全相同(mediamarkt_de GU55/GU65 都抓成 399.99 → 误判 _price_suspect)", "reviews": "底层 BazaarVoice, BV 公开 BFD 接口 401; 站方自家 GraphQL(GetProductReviews, persistedQuery)包一层; 第1页评价随 SSR 内联 window.__PRELOADED_STATE__.apolloState(GraphqlReview:<id> 实体), 第2页起点评价区分页才发请求", "waf": "自己拼 GraphQL URL 重放第1页200/第2页起429/403(即便带齐 x-flow-id/apollographql-* 头+间隔4s); 但站方页面自己点分页发的请求全200"}, "solution": {"jsonld_fix": "overseas/extract.py jsonld_find_product 重写: 按页面 <link rel=canonical> 路径从 hasVariant 里选中当前尺寸变体(变体缺 aggregateRating 时用主节点字段打底); 修复串尺寸价", "reviews_source": "reviews.source='mms_graphql' → overseas/mms_reviews.py: 不重放, 打开真实 PDP → 移除 #mms-consent-portal-container 同意层 → 点顶部 a[href='#reviews']/button[aria-label='Produktbewertungen'] 展开评价区 → SSR 抽第1页(括号平衡解 apolloState GraphqlReview/GraphqlReviewer 实体) → 点 [data-test='review-pagination-wrapper'] 分页按钮截获站方 GetProductReviews 响应累积; 评价按商品族聚合(reviewProductId 可能是别尺寸), 串尺寸条数记 meta.cross_product, 来源商品号写 review_url 锚点 #mms-src-product=", "validator": "retail_spec.validate: source∈{bazaarvoice_bfd,mms_graphql} 的 api_review_source 豁免 reviews.fields.review_key(评价不在 DOM)"}, "result": {"mediamarkt_de": "GU55M70H=479.0 + 51/51 评价(summary avg4.76), GU65M70H=629.0(与55寸价区分, 证实串尺寸 bug 已修)", "reachable_us_exit": "at/ch/de/es/hu/it/nl/pl/tr 搜索200/12张卡; be/saturn_de 403(反爬, spec 已写好标 _block_status 待换欧洲出口)", "selfcheck": "259 spec 全过"}, "lesson": "(1)同平台多国站只需实测一站(mediamarkt_de), 字段用 data-test 整组通用, 语言只差 URL 前缀 (2)JSON-LD ProductGroup/hasVariant 必须按 canonical 选中当前尺寸变体, 否则同系列不同尺寸串价(表现为 _price_suspect 的'不同型号价格完全相同') (3)SPA 站方 GraphQL 带 persistedQuery+WAF 时, 不要拼 URL 重放(会被拦), 应在真实页面点 UI 截获站方自己的请求 (4)第1页评价常随 SSR 内联 apolloState, 需从原始 HTML 括号平衡提取(undefined→null)", "playbook": "spa_graphql_capture_not_replay"}
